@startuml
title 卷积系统关键技术交互时序图

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ParticipantPadding 18
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    ParticipantBorderColor #475569
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E2E8F0
    ActorBorderColor #1D4ED8
    ActorBackgroundColor #DBEAFE
}

actor User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "/convolution" as ConvPage
participant "/digit-recognition" as DigitPage
participant "Flask" as Flask
participant "image_utils.py" as ImgOps
participant "digit_infer_numpy.py" as Infer
database "numpy_mnist_cnn.npz" as Weights

== Basic convolution ==
User -> Frontend : open convolution page
Frontend -> Flask : GET /convolution
Flask --> Frontend : convolution.html + CSS/JS
Frontend -> ConvPage : init matrices and kernels
ConvPage -> ConvPage : compute output size
ConvPage -> ConvPage : render input / kernel / feature maps
User -> ConvPage : step / play / animate
ConvPage -> ConvPage : highlight window and output cell

== Image convolution ==
User -> ConvPage : upload image and choose kernel
ConvPage -> Flask : POST /convolve-image
Flask -> ImgOps : convolve_gray_image()
ImgOps -> ImgOps : NumPy convolution
ImgOps --> Flask : result image
Flask --> ConvPage : JSON result

== Digit recognition ==
User -> Frontend : open digit-recognition
Frontend -> Flask : GET /digit-recognition
Flask -> Infer : get_model_status()
Infer -> Weights : check parameter file
Weights --> Infer : status
Flask --> Frontend : digit_recognition.html

User -> DigitPage : draw digit
DigitPage -> Flask : POST /api/digit-recognize
Flask -> Infer : predict_digit(image)
Infer -> Infer : decode + preprocess + infer
Infer --> Flask : prediction / confidence / probabilities
Flask --> DigitPage : JSON

@enduml
